#     86:    631: !
#     86:    632: ! { ************************************************************************
#     86:    633: !
#     86:    634: ! Program object sizes and characteristics, sync with pint. These define
#     86:    635: ! the machine specific characteristics of the target.
#     86:    636: !
#     86:    637: ! The configurations are as follows:
#     86:    638: !
#     86:    639: ! type                  #bits 32  #bits 64
#     86:    640: ! ===========================================================
#     86:    641: ! integer               32        64
#     86:    642: ! real                  64        64
#     86:    643: ! char                  8         8
#     86:    644: ! boolean               8         8
#     86:    645: ! set                   256       256
